<title>TURKEY: Istanbul stock exchange suspends Data brokerage.</title>
<headline>Istanbul stock exchange suspends Data brokerage.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Istanbul Stock Exchange (ISE) suspended operations of Data Menkul Kiymetler Ticareti A.S., an Istanbul based brokorage house, on the floor, the ISE said on Monday.</p>
<p>The ISE did not disclose the reason for the suspension.</p>
<p>Turkey's Capital Markets Board (SPK) and Data officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
